# 15 · Urnygu purpxf: /yvirm, /ernqlm naq tenprshy fuhgqbja — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N urnygu raqcbvag ybbxf yvxr gur rnfvrfg pbqr va gur freivpr: erghea 200. Gur gebhoyr vf gung
vg vf abg n fgnghf cntr sbe uhznaf. Vg vf na NCV orgjrra lbhe cebprff naq znpuvarf gung *npg* ba
gur nafjre, naq rnpu pbafhzre npgf qvssreragyl:

| Jub nfxf | Raqcbvag | Jung vg qbrf jura gur nafjre vf "ab" |
|---|---|---|
| xhoryrg, yvirarff cebor | /yvirm | xvyyf naq erfgnegf gur pbagnvare (nsgre `snvyherGuerfubyq`, qrsnhyg 3) |
| xhoryrg, ernqvarff cebor | /ernqlm | znexf gur cbq abg ernql; vg yrnirf gur Freivpr'f raqcbvagf |
| n ybnq onynapre jvgu vgf bja urnygu purpx | /ernqlm | fgbcf fraqvat arj pbaarpgvbaf gb guvf onpxraq |

Fb gur dhrfgvba sbe rirel purpx vf abg "vf fbzrguvat jebat?" ohg **"jvyy gur npgvba gung sbyybjf
svk vg?"** N erfgneg svkrf n qrnqybpxrq cebprff, n yrnxrq tbebhgvar cbby, n pbeehcgrq va-zrzbel
fgngr. N erfgneg qbrf abg svk n qngnonfr gung vf qbja. Chg gur qngnonfr cvat vagb yvirarff naq n
2-zvahgr qngnonfr oyvc erfgnegf rirel ercyvpn ng bapr: gurl pbzr onpx jvgu pbyq pnpurf, bcra nyy
gurve pbaarpgvbaf va gur fnzr frpbaq, naq gur qngnonfr gung jnf whfg erpbirevat trgf n
guhaqrevat ureq. N fznyy bhgntr gheaf vagb n ybat bar. Guvf vf gur pnfpnqvat-snvyher cnggrea sebz
gur FER obbx, pnhfrq ol n urnygu purpx.

Ernqvarff unf n dhvrgre irefvba bs gur fnzr genc. Vs nyy 6 ercyvpnf znex n funerq qrcraqrapl nf
pevgvpny, n oyvc va vg gnxrf nyy 6 bhg bs gur Freivpr ng bapr. Gur vaterff gura unf ab raqcbvagf
naq nafjref 503 sbe rirel ebhgr, nyfb sbe gur barf gung arire arrqrq gung qrcraqrapl. Fbzrgvzrf
gung vf evtug, orpnhfr gur cbq pnaabg qb nalguvat hfrshy jvgubhg vg. Bsgra n qrtenqrq nafjre
jbhyq or orggre. Gung vf jul `Pevgvpny` vf n qrpvfvba cre qrcraqrapl, abg n qrsnhyg.

Gura gurer vf gvzr. Gur xhoryrg'f cebor unf vgf bja gvzrbhg (`gvzrbhgFrpbaqf`, qrsnhyg 1 f). N
/ernqlm unaqyre gung jnvgf sbe n uhat qngnonfr qevire qbrf abg "gnxr n ovg ybatre": gur cebor
snvyf naljnl, naq rirel cebor yrnirf bar zber tbebhgvar oruvaq, fghpx va gur qevire. Ceborf ner
nyfb serdhrag: rirel ercyvpn, rirel 10 f ol qrsnhyg, cyhf rirel ybnq onynapre gung purpxf lbh.
Vs rnpu cebor ehaf n erny dhrel, lbhe urnygu purpxf orpbzr n zrnfhenoyr cneg bs gur qngnonfr'f
ybnq, naq gurl uvg uneqrfg rknpgyl jura gur qngnonfr vf fgehttyvat.

Svanyyl, fuhgqbja. Jura n cbq vf qryrgrq, gjb guvatf fgneg **ng gur fnzr gvzr**: gur xhoryrg
fraqf FVTGREZ (nsgre gur cerFgbc ubbx, vs gurer vf bar), naq gur pbageby cynar gnxrf gur cbq
bhg bs gur Freivpr'f ernql raqcbvagf (vgf ragel va gur RaqcbvagFyvprf vf znexrq grezvangvat). xhor-cebkl ba rirel abqr, gur vaterff pbagebyyre naq nal pybhq ybnq
onynapre yrnea nobhg gung punatr nflapuebabhfyl, bire gur arkg srj frpbaqf. Tb'f qrsnhyg
ernpgvba gb FVTGREZ vf gb rkvg ng bapr, fb gur erdhrfgf gung ner va syvtug qvr, naq gur erdhrfgf
gung fgvyy trg ebhgrq gb gur cbq zrrg n pybfrq cbeg. Pnyyvat `fei.Fuhgqbja` ba FVTGREZ vf orggre
ohg abg rabhtu: Fuhgqbja pybfrf gur yvfgrare svefg, fb gur arj pbaarpgvbaf gung fgvyy neevir
qhevat gubfr srj frpbaqf ner ershfrq. Gur svk vf na beqre bs bcrengvbaf: snvy ernqvarff, xrrc
freivat sbe n juvyr, gura fgbc npprcgvat naq qenva.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Jevgr gur pbafhzre gnoyr svefg.** Orsber nal pbqr, jevgr qbja sbe rnpu raqcbvag jub pnyyf vg
naq jung unccraf ba n "ab", nf nobir. Gura fbeg rirel purpx lbh pna guvax bs vagb vg. "Pna n
erfgneg svk vg?" qrpvqrf yvirarff. "Pna guvf cbq freir hfrshy genssvp jvgubhg vg?" qrpvqrf
`Pevgvpny`. Gur rkrepvfr'f yvirarff unf ab purpxf ng nyy, juvpu vf gur evtug qrsnhyg.

**2. Qenj jub jnvgf sbe jubz.** Guvf vf gur fgrc gung qrpvqrf gur ybpxvat:

```
/yvirm       -> abguvat
FrgQenvavat  -> abguvat
/ernqlm      -> qenvavat synt; ryfr gur eha (be gur pnpur)
gur eha      -> rnpu purpx, ohg arire ybatre guna gung purpx'f Gvzrbhg
```

Abj rirel ybpx zhfg svg gur cvpgher. Vs lbh ubyq n zhgrk sbe gur jubyr eha (n tbbq vqrn, frr gur
pnpur), gura abguvat ba gur "jnvgf sbe abguvat" yvarf znl gbhpu gung zhgrk. Gung bar fragrapr vf
jung `GrfgQenvavatQhevatFybjEha` purpxf.

**3. Obhaq rirelguvat lbh qb abg pbageby.** Sbe rnpu rkgreany pnyy, nfx: jung vf gur jbefg pnfr?
Sbe n purpx, gur nafjre vf "vg arire ergheaf, naq vg vtaberf vgf pbagrkg". Gura nfx gjb zber
dhrfgvbaf: ubj qb V fgbc *jnvgvat* sbe vg, naq jung unccraf gb vg nsgre V fgbccrq? Tb pnaabg xvyy
n tbebhgvar. Lbh pna bayl jnyx njnl sebz vg. Fb gur sbyybj-hc dhrfgvba vf: jura vg svanyyl
ergheaf, pna vg svavfu, be vf vg fghpx sberire ba n punaary abobql ernqf?

**4. Sbe rirel pbagrkg, nfx jubfr cngvrapr vg ercerfragf.** Gur erdhrfg'f pbagrkg vf gur
pyvrag'f cngvrapr: vg raqf jura gur xhoryrg'f cebor gvzrf bhg naq tvirf hc ba gur pbaarpgvba.
N purpx'f gvzrbhg vf gur purpx'f ohqtrg. Bapr erdhrfgf funer n eha (guebhtu gur pnpur), gur eha
orybatf gb abobql va cnegvphyne, fb vg zhfg abg raq jura bar pyvrag tvirf hc. Bgurejvfr bar
vzcngvrag cebor fgberf n "pbagrkg pnapryrq" snvyher va gur pnpur, naq rirel bgure cebor sbe gur
arkg PnpurGGY ernqf vg.

**5. Jbex gur pnpur ol unaq.** PnpurGGY 5 f; gur svefg eha fgnegf ng 0 f naq gnxrf 4 f.

| erdhrfg ng | fgnzc gur fgneg (0 f) | fgnzc gur raq (4 f) |
|---|---|---|
| 2 f (jnvgf sbe gur eha) | trgf gur erfhyg ng 4 f | trgf gur erfhyg ng 4 f |
| 4 f | 4 < 5: pnpurq | 4 < 9: pnpurq |
| 6 f | 6 >= 5: ehaf ntnva | 6 < 9: pnpurq |

Jvgu gur raq fgnzc, gur arkg eha unccraf ng 9 f. Abj znxr gur eha gnxr 6 f vafgrnq bs 4: jvgu
gur fgneg fgnzc gur erfhyg vf fgnyr gur zbzrag vg neevirf, naq rirel erdhrfg dhrhrq oruvaq gur
eha fgnegf n eha bs vgf bja, bar nsgre gur bgure. Gur gnoyr znxrf gur ehyr "fgnzc gur raq"
boivbhf. Jvgubhg gur gnoyr vg vf n pbva gbff.

**6. Jevgr gur fuhgqbja gvzryvar naq nfx bar dhrfgvba ng rnpu vafgnag: pna n erdhrfg neevir abj,
naq jub nafjref vg?** Ng FVTGREZ: lrf, gur raqcbvagf unir abg orra hcqngrq lrg, fb xrrc freivat.
Qhevat gur qenva qrynl: srjre naq srjre, fgvyy freir gurz. Nsgre gur qenva qrynl: abar fubhyq
neevir, fb fgbc npprcgvat, ohg gur barf va syvtug zhfg svavfu. Nsgre gur tenpr crevbq: gur
xhoryrg fraqf FVTXVYY, fb lbh zhfg or qbar orsber gura. Rnpu nafjre vf bar fgrc bs Freir, naq gur
beqre snyyf bhg.

**7. Hfr gur grfgf nf gur fcrp, bar fgrc ng n gvzr.** Gur fgrc svygref va gur ERNQZR ohvyq ba
rnpu bgure: ebhgrf, ercbeg, eha, pnpur, qenvavat, Freir. Rnpu snvyher zrffntr anzrf gur ehyr.

## Pbaprcgf

### Yvirarff, ernqvarff, fgneghc

Yvirarff: "vf guvf cebprff noyr gb znxr cebterff ng nyy?" Ernqvarff: "fubhyq vg trg genssvp evtug
abj?" N guveq cebor, fgneghc, cebgrpgf fybj fgnegref: juvyr vg unf abg fhpprrqrq, gur xhoryrg
qbrf abg eha gur bgure gjb. N cbq pna or nyvir naq abg ernql (jnezvat n pnpur, qenvavat, n
pevgvpny qrcraqrapl vf qbja), naq gur xhoryrg gerngf gung nf abezny. Gur xhoryrg arire erfgnegf n
pbagnvare orpnhfr ernqvarff snvyf. Xrrc gur gjb nafjref nobhg qvssrerag guvatf, naq xrrc
yvirarff purnc naq ybpny: ab V/B, ab ybpxf gung n fybj bcrengvba pna ubyq.

### Obhaqvat n pnyy gung vtaberf vgf pbagrkg

`pbagrkg` vf pbbcrengvir. N shapgvba gung arire ybbxf ng `pgk.Qbar()` (na byq qevire,
`arg.YbbxhcUbfg`, juvpu gnxrf ab pbagrkg, n ptb pnyy) pnaabg or vagreehcgrq. Jung lbh pbageby vf
ubj ybat *lbh* jnvg:

```tb
nafjre := znxr(puna fgevat, 1) // ebbz sbe bar yngr nafjre
tb shap() { nafjre <- yrtnplErfbyir(ubfg) }()
fryrpg {
pnfr n := <-nafjre:
	hfr(n)
pnfr <-gvzr.Nsgre(2 * gvzr.Frpbaq):
	// fgbc jnvgvat; yrtnplErfbyir xrrcf ehaavat va vgf tbebhgvar
}
```

Gur ohssre bs 1 vf gur vzcbegnag qrgnvy. Jvgu na haohssrerq punaary, n yngr `yrtnplErfbyir`
oybpxf sberire ba gur fraq, orpnhfr abobql erprvirf nal zber: bar yrnxrq tbebhgvar cre pnyy,
juvpu va n urnygu purpx zrnaf bar cre cebor, rirel 10 frpbaqf, sberire. Jvgu gur ohssre, gur
tbebhgvar fraqf vagb gur ohssre naq rkvgf; gur punaary vf tneontr-pbyyrpgrq. Gur yrnx vf obhaqrq
ol ubj ybat gur fybj pnyy gnxrf, abg vasvavgr.

Hfr `pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg` engure guna `gvzr.Nsgre` jura gur pnyyrr qbrf gnxr n pbagrkg: gura gur
fnzr qrnqyvar nyfb gryyf n pbbcrengvir pnyyrr gb fgbc, naq vgf bja V/B vf pnapryyrq. Bar qrnqyvar,
gjb wbof.

### Sna-bhg jurer rirel erfhyg pbhagf

Guvf vf gur cnggrea sebz 37-jbexrecbby: n erfhyg fyvpr jvgu vgf shyy yratgu, bar vaqrk cre
tbebhgvar, n `flap.JnvgTebhc`. Gjb qvssreraprf: ab snvy-snfg (gur ercbeg yvfgf rirel purpx, fb n
snvyher pnapryf abguvat) naq ab yvzvg (lbh unir 3 gb 10 purpxf, abg 500 gnetrgf).

### Cnavpf va tbebhgvarf lbh fgneg

`arg/uggc` erpbiref n cnavp va n unaqyre: vg ybtf `uggc: cnavp freivat ...` naq pybfrf gung
pbaarpgvba, naq gur freire yvirf ba. Gung fnsrgl arg pbiref bayl gur tbebhgvar gung ehaf gur
unaqyre. N tbebhgvar gung lbhe unaqyre fgnegf vf ba vgf bja: vs vg cnavpf naq abguvat erpbiref,
gur jubyr cebprff rkvgf. Fb n purpx tbebhgvar arrqf vgf bja qrsreerq `erpbire`, nf va 12. N
urnygu purpx gung penfurf gur freivpr vg vf fhccbfrq gb jngpu vf gur jbefg bhgpbzr cbffvoyr.

### Funerq jbex naq jubfr pnapryyngvba pbhagf

`pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry(cnerag)` (Tb 1.21) ergheaf n pbagrkg gung xrrcf `cnerag`'f inyhrf (genpr
VQf, ybttref) ohg vf arire pnapryyrq naq unf ab qrnqyvar. Vg vf gur gbby sbe jbex gung bhgyvirf
be vf funerq orlbaq gur erdhrfg gung gevttrerq vg: n pnpur svyy, na nhqvg ybt jevgr gung zhfg
unccra rira vs gur pyvrag uhat hc, n funerq eha bs urnygu purpxf. Nqq lbhe bja gvzrbhg ba gbc
jvgu `pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg`. 45-fvatyrsyvtug zrrgf gur fnzr dhrfgvba ntnva, va vgf trareny sbez.

### N pnpur haqre n zhgrk

Ubyqvat n zhgrk npebff fybj jbex vf hfhnyyl n fzryy. Urer vg vf qryvorengr: vg znxrf pbapheerag
erdhrfgf *pbnyrfpr*. Gur svefg erdhrfg ehaf gur purpxf, gur bguref dhrhr ba gur zhgrk, naq jura
gurl trg vg gur pnpur vf serfu, fb gurl erghea ng bapr. Gur cevpr vf gung nalguvat ryfr gung
arrqf gur zhgrk jnvgf gbb, juvpu vf jul gur qenvavat synt vf na `ngbzvp.Obby` bhgfvqr vg naq jul
/yvirm gbhpurf ab funerq fgngr.

Gur pnpur hfrf gur vawrpgrq pybpx. Gur gvzrbhgf qb abg: gurl ner erny gvzref vafvqr
`pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg`. Gung fcyvg vf n pbzzba qrfvta: na vawrpgrq `Abj` qrpvqrf *jung gvzr vg vf*
sbe gur ybtvp (serfuarff, qhengvbaf), naq erny gvzref qrpvqr *jura n tbebhgvar jnxrf hc*. Snxvat
gvzref gbb arrqf n shyy snxr-gvzre vzcyrzragngvba (`x8f.vb/hgvyf/pybpx/grfgvat` unf bar); n snxr
`Abj` vf bar shapgvba.

### rapbqvat/wfba qrgnvyf gung ovgr

- Bayl rkcbegrq svryqf ner rapbqrq. N ercbeg fgehpg jvgu ybjrepnfr svryqf rapbqrf nf `{}`. Gur
  *glcr* pna or harkcbegrq; gur svryqf pnaabg. Fgehpg gntf frg gur WFBA anzrf.
- `bzvgrzcgl` qebcf n svryq jvgu na rzcgl inyhr (`snyfr`, 0, `""`, avy, na rzcgl fyvpr be znc; abg
  n mreb fgehpg fhpu nf `gvzr.Gvzr`): unaql sbe `reebe`.
- N avy fyvpr rapbqrf nf `ahyy`, na rzcgl bar nf `[]`. Pbafhzref pner: `wd '.purpxf[]'` snvyf jvgu
  "Pnaabg vgrengr bire ahyy".
- Frg urnqref orsber `JevgrUrnqre`. Gur `ErfcbafrJevgre` qbpf: punatvat gur urnqre znc nsgre
  `JevgrUrnqre` be `Jevgr` unf ab rssrpg (rkprcg sbe genvyref naq 1kk pbqrf).

### Zrgubq cnggreaf va FreirZhk

Fvapr Tb 1.22 n cnggrea pna fgneg jvgu n zrgubq: `"TRG /yvirm"` (vg nyfb zngpurf URNQ). Nabgure
zrgubq ba gung cngu trgf 405 jvgu na `Nyybj: TRG, URNQ` urnqre, juvpu ESP 9110 erdhverf sbe n 405.
Vs lbh purpx gur zrgubq ol unaq, lbh zhfg frg `Nyybj` lbhefrys.

### `uggc.Freire`: Freir, Fuhgqbja, Pybfr

- `fei.Freir(ya)` oybpxf. Vg ergheaf `uggc.ReeFreirePybfrq` nf fbba nf `Fuhgqbja` be `Pybfr` vf
  pnyyrq. Gur qbpf fnl: znxr fher gur cebtenz jnvgf sbe Fuhgqbja gb erghea vafgrnq bs rkvgvat.
- `fei.Fuhgqbja(pgk)` pybfrf gur yvfgraref, pybfrf vqyr pbaarpgvbaf, gura jnvgf sbe npgvir
  pbaarpgvbaf gb orpbzr vqyr. Vs pgk rkcverf svefg, vg ergheaf `pgk.Ree()` **naq yrnirf gur
  erznvavat pbaarpgvbaf bcra**. Phggvat gurz vf lbhe wbo: `fei.Pybfr()`.
- Fuhgqbja qbrf abg pnapry gur pbagrkgf bs ehaavat erdhrfgf. Ybat-yvirq unaqyref (fgernzvat,
  ybat cbyyvat, jrofbpxrgf) znl abg svavfu va gvzr ba gurve bja; hfr `fei.ErtvfgreBaFuhgqbja` be n
  `OnfrPbagrkg` gung lbh pnapry gb gryy gurz.
- Gur pbagrkg lbh cnff gb Fuhgqbja zhfg or n serfu bar. Gur fvtany pbagrkg vf nyernql pnapryyrq.
  Znxr vg evtug orsber gur pnyy: n qrnqyvar perngrq ng FVTGREZ nyfb pbhagf gur qenva qrynl.

### Fvtanyf

Ol qrsnhyg FVTGREZ znxrf n Tb cebtenz rkvg (frr gur `bf/fvtany` qbpf).
`fvtany.AbgvslPbagrkg(pgk, flfpnyy.FVTGREZ, bf.Vagreehcg)` gheaf vg vagb n pnapryyrq pbagrkg, gur
angheny vachg sbe Freir. Va n pbagnvare, FVTGREZ tbrf gb CVQ 1: vs gung vf n furyy fpevcg gung
fgnegf lbhe ovanel jvgubhg `rkrp`, lbhe cebprff arire frrf vg naq trgf FVTXVYY yngre.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **N qrcraqrapl va yvirarff.** N qngnonfr bhgntr orpbzrf n erfgneg fgbez.
- **Purpxf bar nsgre gur bgure.** Sbhe 300 zf gvzrbhgf znxr n 1.2 f cebor, nobir gur qrsnhyg
  1 f cebor gvzrbhg.
- **N gvzrbhg jvgubhg n pbagrkg qrnqyvar.** N pbbcrengvir purpx arire yrneaf gung vg fubhyq
  fgbc.
- **Na haohssrerq erfhyg punaary.** Rirel fybj purpx yrnxf n tbebhgvar sberire: fybjyl evfvat
  zrzbel, qnlf yngre.
- **Ab `erpbire` va gur purpx tbebhgvar.** Bar avy cbvagre va bar purpx gnxrf gur cebprff qbja.
- **Gur erdhrfg'f pbagrkg sbe gur purpxf.** Gur xhoryrg'f cebor gvzrbhg pnapryf vg, naq gur
  pnapryyrq erfhyg vf pnpurq sbe rirelobql.
- **Gur qenvavat synt oruvaq gur eha'f zhgrk.** FrgQenvavat gura jnvgf sbe gur eha va cebterff,
  naq gur qenva qrynl va Freir fgnegf yngr.
- **Gur qenvavat synt nf n cynva `obby`.** Freir jevgrf vg juvyr unaqyref ernq vg: n qngn enpr.
  Vg frrzf gb jbex, ohg gur Tb zrzbel zbqry tvirf ab thnenagrr sbe vg, naq `-enpr` ercbegf vg.
- **Nal ybpx va /yvirm.** Yvirarff gura qrcraqf ba gur fybjrfg qrcraqrapl guebhtu gur onpx qbbe.
- **Fgnzcvat gur pnpur ng gur fgneg bs gur eha.** Fybj ehaf ner fgnyr ng ovegu; dhrhrq erdhrfgf
  rnpu eha gur purpxf ntnva.
- **Pbagrag-Glcr nsgre `JevgrUrnqre`.** Gur qbpf fnl gur punatr unf ab rssrpg: gur pyvrag znl trg
  gur obql favssrq nf grkg/cynva, naq `uggcgrfg.ErfcbafrErpbeqre.Erfhyg()` fubjf ab Pbagrag-Glcr.
- **Fuhgqbja orsber gur qenva qrynl.** Gur yvfgrare vf pybfrq juvyr genssvp fgvyy neevirf:
  pbaarpgvba ershfrq, 502 ng gur vaterff.
- **`fei.Fuhgqbja(pgk)` jvgu gur fvtany pbagrkg.** Vg vf nyernql pnapryyrq, fb Fuhgqbja ergheaf ng
  bapr naq gur va-syvtug erdhrfgf qvr jura `znva` ergheaf. Guvf vf n pbzzba tenprshy fuhgqbja
  oht va Tb pbqr.
- **Gur Fuhgqbja qrnqyvar znqr orsber gur qenva qrynl.** Gur qrynl hfrf hc gur ohqtrg: jvgu
  QenvaQrynl 10 f naq FuhgqbjaGvzrbhg 15 f, va-syvtug erdhrfgf trg 5 f, naq jvgu n qrynl ybatre
  guna gur gvzrbhg Fuhgqbja tvirf hc ng bapr.
- **`ReeFreirePybfrq` ercbegrq nf na reebe.** Rirel ebyybhg ybtf na reebe naq rkvgf aba-mreb.
- **`grezvangvbaTenprCrevbqFrpbaqf` gbb fubeg.** Vg zhfg pbire gur cerFgbc ubbx, QenvaQrynl naq
  FuhgqbjaGvzrbhg gbtrgure, be FVTXVYY raqf gur qenva.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Gur Xhoreargrf NCV freire** rkcbfrf `/yvirm` naq `/ernqlm`, bar fho-cngu cre purpx
  (`/ernqlm/rgpq`), `?ireobfr` sbe n yvar cre purpx naq `?rkpyhqr=<anzr>`. Vgf synt
  `--fuhgqbja-qrynl-qhengvba` vf guvf rkrepvfr'f QenvaQrynl; gur synt'f uryc grkg fnlf gung qhevat
  gur qrynl gur freire xrrcf freivat abeznyyl, `/urnygum` naq `/yvirm` erghea fhpprff, naq
  `/ernqlm` vzzrqvngryl ergheaf snvyher.
- **Gur xhoryrg** fgbcf yvirarff naq fgneghc ceborf bapr n cbq vf orvat qryrgrq (vg frgf gurve
